OL,3,GNEWSARomance fraudster loses repayment
OL,4,Aappeal bid
OL,5,
OL,6,FA notorious romance fraudster has had
OL,7,Fan appeal against repaying his victim
OL,8,Frefused.
OL,10,FMark Acklom had asked the Court of
OL,11,FAppeal to overturn an order to repay
OL,12,FCarolyn Woods #125,000.
OL,14,FAcklom met Woods in Gloucestershire in
OL,15,F2012 and pretended to be an MI6 agent,
OL,16,Fa Swiss banker and a property developer
OL,17,Fto defraud her of her life savings.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
