OL,3,GNEWSARomance fraudster loses repayment
OL,4,Aappeal bid
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt the Court of Appeal, Lord Justice
OL,7,FFraser confirmed the Proceeds of Crime
OL,8,FAct confiscation order and said the
OL,9,Fpurpose of the law "would be
OL,10,Fundermined" if his appeal had been
OL,11,Fsuccessful.
